OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo arriving around
OL,6,Fdawn to bring patchy rain, with some
OL,7,Fheavy bursts, and strengthening winds.
OL,8,FGradually worsening weather through
OL,9,Fthe day, feeling unpleasant in the
OL,10,Fafternoon with persistent heavy rain,
OL,11,Fstrong winds and gales possible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDrying up for most in the
OL,14,Fevening with only the odd shower
OL,15,Faround. Becoming increasingly windy
OL,16,Fduring the evening with occasional
OL,17,Fgales inland, stronger still along
OL,18,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
