OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStrong winds throughout the
OL,6,Fday, easing to a brisk breeze by the
OL,7,Fevening. Perhaps a light shower during
OL,8,Fthe morning but sunny intervals
OL,9,Fotherwise.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOn
OL,12,FMonday morning, heavy rain will pass
OL,13,Ffollowed by strong winds with coastal
OL,14,Fgales. Brighter on Tuesday, with
OL,15,Fscattered showers and strong winds. On
OL,16,FWednesday, sunny spells, showers and
OL,17,Fbreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
